2026-11-11T22:59:57.973-08:00 [reviewer] SENT topic="s0036_final" correlation_id="a7cfcf8f-a225-4122-8c4c-9ba6a82cfc5e" status="approved" answer="The vulnerability addressed is CVE-2020-36518 (not CVE-2021-44228), a high-severity denial of service via deeply nested JSON causing stack overflow. The fix is in jackson-databind version 2.13.2.1. Affected versions are >=2.13.0 but <2.13.2.1. This resolution resolves the stack overflow issue in nested JSON processing. (149 words)\n\nSource record: VULN-0036-HW9-08 (s0036_rel id 20081): jackson-databind affected >= 2.13.0, < 2.13.2.1, severity high. CVE-2020-36518: Denial of service through deeply nested JSON (stack overflow). Fixed in 2.13.2.1."
